<title>EGYPT: Alexandria pharmaceuticals 95/6 profit up.</title>
<headline>Alexandria pharmaceuticals 95/6 profit up.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alexandria Pharmaceuticals and Chemical Industries said on Saturday that after-tax profit was 21.8 million pounds in the financial year 1995/96, up from 20 million pounds in the previous year.</p>
<p>The years end on June 30.</p>
<p>Shareholders' rights were worth 41.55 million pounds, compared with 35.46 million one year earlier, the company balance sheet published on Saturday showed.</p>
<p>Shareholders' portion of the profit was 13.50 million pounds - up from 12.37 million pounds in 1994/5 - for two million shares.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
